; Ignis Varos in the prologue (GAME_DESIGN.md §3.6, §7.2 boss 0; FR-BOS-04): the fight that can't be won. He takes no
; damage (invulnerable), hits hard and fast with every kind of warning at once, and the ScriptedEncounter ends the
; fight after a while or when Aurelia is badly hurt (data/encounters/ignis_prologue.tres); then Sylvaris arrives.
; Rank shown as "???" (GAME_DESIGN.md §5.2: Sovereign, hidden at first). Ember element.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
id = &"ignis_prologue"
display_name = "Ignis Varos"
element = 6
rank = "???"
max_health = 2000.0
defense = 0.0
